	(text_box "Values follow TI's TPS54360B 5 V/3.5 A design example (SNVSB93 §8.2), with basic-library parts:\n  RT 150k → ≈640 kHz;  FB 120k/22k → 5.16 V (covers the switch + shunt drop at the DUT);\n  type-II compensation 13k + 6.8 nF + 47 pF;  EN left floating = always on (internal UVLO).\nInput: SUD50P06 P-FET (reverse polarity, gate clamped by 12 V zener), SMBJ33A clamps < 54 V < 60 V abs max."
